# Component Patterns

## Animation Components

Use existing animation wrappers:

```typescript
import AnimatedCard from '@/components/ui/AnimatedCard'
import AnimatedSection from '@/components/ui/AnimatedSection'
import AnimatedHeading from '@/components/ui/AnimatedHeading'

// ✅ GOOD - Use provided components
<AnimatedSection>
  <AnimatedCard index={0}>
    <h3>Title</h3>
  </AnimatedCard>
</AnimatedSection>
```

## Reusable UI Components

Located in `components/ui/`:
- `Button.tsx` - Standard buttons
- `Card.tsx` - Card wrapper
- `Section.tsx` - Page sections
- `AnimatedCard.tsx` - Animated card
- `AnimatedSection.tsx` - Animated section
- `AnimatedHeading.tsx` - Animated heading
- `AnimatedDiv.tsx` - Generic animated div

Always prefer these over creating custom styled divs.

## Component Organization

```
components/
  ui/              # Reusable UI primitives
  blog/            # Blog-specific components
  educational/     # Educational diagrams/visualizations
  learning-path/   # Learning path features
  layout/          # Layout components (Header, Footer)
  i18n/            # Language switcher
```

## Client Component Patterns

### State Management

```typescript
'use client'

import { useState, useEffect } from 'react'

export default function Component() {
  const [data, setData] = useState<DataType | null>(null)
  
  useEffect(() => {
    // Load data
    const loadData = async () => {
      const result = await fetchData()
      setData(result)
    }
    loadData()
  }, [])
  
  if (!data) return <LoadingSkeleton />
  return <div>{data.content}</div>
}
```

### Loading States

```typescript
// ✅ GOOD - Show loading skeleton
if (!data) {
  return (
    <div className="animate-pulse">
      <div className="h-8 bg-gray-200 rounded w-1/3 mb-4" />
      <div className="h-4 bg-gray-200 rounded w-full" />
    </div>
  )
}

// ❌ BAD - Return null (flashes content)
if (!data) return null
```

## Prop Passing

```typescript
// ✅ GOOD - Pass data from server to client
// server-component.tsx
export default async function ServerPage() {
  const data = await fetchServerData() // Server-side
  return <ClientComponent data={data} />
}

// client-component.tsx
'use client'
export default function ClientComponent({ data }: Props) {
  // Use data
}
```

## Link Components

```typescript
import Link from 'next/link'

// ✅ GOOD - Next.js Link for internal routes
<Link href="/blog" className="text-primary-600 hover:text-primary-700">
  Blog
</Link>

// ✅ GOOD - Regular anchor for external links
<a href="https://external.com" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">
  External
</a>
```

## Image Components

```typescript
import Image from 'next/image'

// ✅ GOOD - Next.js Image with dimensions
<Image
  src="/images/logo.png"
  alt="Logo"
  width={200}
  height={100}
  className="..."
/>

// For dynamic images
<Image
  src={post.featuredImage}
  alt={post.title}
  fill
  className="object-cover"
/>
```
